  {
   "id": "2120057672158638389",
   "text": "The more I think about it the more frustrating it is that Gunn had the opportunity to reboot the whole damn thing & did it the way he did it. Starting out with the Trinity & removing it entirely from what came before was the obvious play. How do you screw that up?",
   "url": "https://x.com/StebobM/status/2120057672158638389",
   "created_at": "2026-11-10T07:35:12+00:00",
   "sent_at": "2026-11-10T07:35:12+00:00",
   "author_name": "Man of Steven",
   "author_handle": "StebobM",
   "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2116652994355728384/3Hs95nPA_normal.jpg",
   "reply_count": 0,
   "repost_count": 0,
   "like_count": 1,
   "image": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWv1NyZWEAAXaja.jpg"
  },
  {
   "id": "2120056538505372061",
   "text": "This is not the same thing at all, I highly doubt the GA even knows or cares about a change in leadership.\n\nIt\u2019s not like everything Gunn was doing was hitting either. If MOT fails it will be because audiences just don\u2019t have the interest in seeing it.",
